# Env, Netlify & Supabase (Twilda)

- **Product:** Twilda · **Company:** Artometrics · **Domain:** `twilda.com`
- **App:** Expo (iOS / Android / web). Web deploys to Netlify site `twilda` (Git deploy from `kylesmcauliffe/twilda`).
- **Public env:** Only `EXPO_PUBLIC_*` (`EXPO_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL`, `EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY`).
- **Secrets:** `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY` is optional server tooling only. Never ship it in the app binary or paste into chat.
- **Templates:** `.env.example` → `.env` locally; set the same vars in Netlify / EAS.
- **Client:** `@/lib/supabase/client` (`getSupabase()`). Prefer anon key + RLS; no Astro SSR cookie clients.
- **Note:** In-app “Codex” panels are lore/character features — not the product name.
- **Setup:** `docs/SETUP.md`
